1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,171
Trap number ten is having no written

2
00:00:02,171 --> 00:00:04,524
plan. A financial goal without a number

3
00:00:04,524 --> 00:00:06,213
and a deadline is not a goal

4
00:00:06,213 --> 00:00:07,660
- it is a wish. Write it

5
00:00:07,660 --> 00:00:09,651
down: ten thousand in the bank by

6
00:00:09,651 --> 00:00:12,245
December, debt free by June, sixty thousand

7
00:00:12,245 --> 00:00:14,718
invested in two years. Numbers with dates

8
00:00:14,718 --> 00:00:17,492
become decisions. Wishes stay vague, and vague

9
00:00:17,492 --> 00:00:20,267
things never happen. People with written plans

10
00:00:20,267 --> 00:00:22,318
do not have better luck; they have

11
00:00:22,318 --> 00:00:23,343
better direction.
